    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About The Inspireist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of the ocean spirit world by accompanying a recent high school graduate, Bulut, who lost all of his memories of family and friends. The Inspireist is a story-rich puzzle adventure narrative set in a recent 21st century, alternate realm Izmrr.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill indie mystery game with 2D hand-drawn animated characters in beautifully rendered 3D  environments with lots of original comics, lore, and conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through, help him remember and inspire Bulut, his family, friends and people of Izmrr</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, unravel the mysteries of Izmrr, the ocean spirit world, and to find more clues to reunite with your other half!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inspireist is currently under development and does not currently have a release date or system requirements. Please add our game to your wishlist and follow our development on our Bluesky or twitter!</p>",
